 partially softened by blur and reflections but still clearly legible as a café window sign. The composition feels like an 85mm lens portrait at a wide aperture, with creamy bokeh, realistic skin detail, natural textures, and a refined lifestyle-advertising mood. Ambient café sounds are implied through the environment: soft coffee-shop chatter, distant espresso-machine tones, gentle window ambience, and the warm glow of signage blending into the quiet interior atmosphere."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 710, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 484, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [682, 733], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [482.46929931640625, 70.76473999023438], "pos": [-49.14131164550781, 2598.441650390625], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 473, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors", "directory": "vae", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.36.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 